NANA MAI AGAYI HU GHAR BAR SAB LUTAKE...<br>
<br>
Nana mai agayi hu ghar bar sab lutake,<br>
Zehra ke gulista'n se Karbobala saja ke.<br>
<br>
Nana tumhari Zainab ab woh nahi rahi hai,<br>
Pehchan na sakoge halat badal gayi hai,<br>
Mousam guzare maine har gaam bas jafa ke.<br>
<br>
Hum seh rahe the Nana jo jo bhi gham huwe the,<br>
Shayed bata na paau jitne sitam huwe the,<br>
Lekin tumhari ummat khush thi hame satake.<br>
<br>
Kadiyal jawa'n ke dil pe zalim ne mara naiza,<br>
Bhai ne kis tarah se seene se woh nikala,<br>
Qaime se lasha lane Sheh kis tarah uthake.<br>
<br>
Qasim ke haye tan ko pamaal kardiya tha,<br>
Ghatri me Shaah laye ye haal kardiya tha,<br>
Tukde huwe badan ke Farwa ke dilruba ke.<br>
<br>
Nana mere pisar bhi maqtal me khogaye hai,<br>
Abbas ibne Haider dariya pe sogaye hai,<br>
Raahe Khuda me baazu dono waha'n katake.<br>
<br>
Besheer tashnalab tha teere sitam se chuta,<br>
Usko bhi haye Nana teere sitam se maara,<br>
Asghar ki laash Sarwar laye magar chupake.<br>
<br>
Noke sina se cheeni zalim ne sar se chadar,<br>
Khoo'n hogaya tha jaari zakhmou se bhar gaya sar,<br>
Shamo damishqo kufa phirte the berida ke.<br>
<br>
Nana teri nawasi darbar bhi gayi thi,<br>
Be jurm banke qaidi zindaan me rahi thi,<br>
Qaide sitam se aayi Nana saza batake.<br>
<br>
'Abbas' dekh Zainab Yasrab se agayi hai,<br>
Qabre Rasool par ye nouha suna rahi hai,<br>
Usko padho bilawal tum ashke gham bahake...